[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 9961.349, "timestamp": "02:46:01", "text": "是数量无限的枪支，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9963.15, "timestamp": "02:46:03", "text": "有枪支"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9968.03, "timestamp": "02:46:08", "text": "呃呃，曾经，嗯，就像，该怎么称呼它呢？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9971.349, "timestamp": "02:46:11", "text": "呃，有些枪，呃，是正常的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9974.309, "timestamp": "02:46:14", "text": "盔甲、装备和能力。有些人确实如此"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9976.99, "timestamp": "02:46:16", "text": "损失更大，等等。这是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9979.389, "timestamp": "02:46:19", "text": "凉爽的。那就是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9984.71, "timestamp": "02:46:24", "text": "凉爽的。咱们骑上我的自行车吧。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9987.21, "timestamp": "02:46:27", "text": "未来主义"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9989.15, "timestamp": "02:46:29", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9997.95, "timestamp": "02:46:37", "text": "那。我不能"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10000.95, "timestamp": "02:46:40", "text": "去。而且这款游戏中的驾驶体验也很棒。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10008.91, "timestamp": "02:46:48", "text": "疼痛。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10012.429, "timestamp": "02:46:52", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10014.87, "timestamp": "02:46:54", "text": "是的。是的。呃，只有一小部分"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10018.95, "timestamp": "02:46:58", "text": "模糊。对，我最讨厌的就是那种模糊效果。"}]